    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At Lang Ya Blessed Land, Fang Yuan spends one of his three refinement chances on stargate Gu, and the land spirit hands him a finished pair of oval blue gemstone Gu. He sends one into Hu Immortal blessed land, activates the other under a star-filled sky, and steps through into the blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          465
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "first-refinement-form-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Stargate Gu comes in pairs and is not split into main and sub Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          466
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "first-refinement-form-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It looks like an oval blue gemstone, and when activated starlight gathers until a door forms.",
        "chapters": [
          465
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "first-refinement-form-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Even a rank five peak stage Gu Master cannot sustain the primeval essence cost for three breaths; continuous use needs immortal essence. Inside Hu Immortal blessed land, starlight comes from starlight firefly Gu, and keeping a gate open kills one firefly every three breaths.",
        "chapters": [
          466
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "first-refinement-form-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
